  <!-- EN: nexusmeld -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.label>统合母兽</FH_Nexusmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. The nexusmeld is the core of the fleshbeast swarm's coordination, using its powerful psychic abilities to command other fleshbeasts in assaults. Nexusmelds rarely appear in raids, preferring to lurk within nests supported by fleshmass hearts, with which they share a psychic bond. -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.description>由数几十只小型血肉兽组成的庞然大物，通过松散相连的中枢神经系统协调统一。统合母兽是血肉兽调配系统的核心，其强大的精神能力可以指挥其他血肉兽进行袭击。统合母兽很少出现在袭击中，它更喜欢躲在有血肉心脏支撑的巢穴中。它与血肉心脏间存在着心灵感应。</FH_Nexusmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中涌现。</FH_Nexusmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.tools.tentacle.label>触手</FH_Nexusmeld.tools.tentacle.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Nexusmeld.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Nexusmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: furiousmeld -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.label>暴怒母兽</FH_Furiousmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. It grows a thick carapace of living iron and can project a spherical bioprotective forcefield that allows bullets to pass out but not in. Furiousmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the furiousmeld charges headlong to destroy defenses while掩护ing lesser fleshbeasts to overwhelm the enemy. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.description>由数几十只小型血肉兽组成的庞然大物，通过松散相连的中枢神经系统协调统一。生长着厚重的活铁质甲壳，并且可以投射出一个球形的生物防护力场让子弹能够射出而无法射入。暴怒母兽很少出现在袭击中，通常只能通过仪式召唤。暴怒母兽在战斗中通常会横冲直撞毁坏防御设施，掩护血肉兽淹没敌人。</FH_Furiousmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中涌现。</FH_Furiousmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.tentacle.label>触手</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.tentacle.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Furiousmeld.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Furiousmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: bastionmeld -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.label>铁骸母兽</FH_Bastionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. Its body is embedded with the remnants of various mechanoids, which it controls through some form of supernatural energy. Bastionmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. In combat, the bastionmeld constructs defensive fortifications and wears down enemies through sustained long-range combat. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.description>由数几十只小型血肉兽组成的庞然大物，通过松散相连的中枢神经系统协调统一。身躯上镶嵌着各种机械族的残骸。铁骸母兽通过某种超自然能量控制着这些原本属于机械族的武装。铁骸母兽很少出现在袭击中，通常只能通过仪式召唤。铁骸母兽在战斗中通常会构筑防御工事，并以远距离战斗不断消耗并战胜敌人。</FH_Bastionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中涌现。</FH_Bastionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.tools.tentacle.label>触手</FH_Bastionmeld.tools.tentacle.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Bastionmeld.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Bastionmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: fissionmeld -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.label>裂殖母兽</FH_Fissionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. Its body undergoes constant rapid hyperplasia, with new fleshbeasts budding from its form at regular intervals. These parasitic offspring make the fissionmeld a terrifying meat grinder. Fissionmelds rarely appear in raids and can usually only be summoned through rituals. Upon death, the fissionmeld enters a dormant state and will eventually regenerate. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.description>由数几十只小型血肉兽组成的庞然大物，通过松散相连的中枢神经系统协调统一。它的身体不断的快速增生，每隔一段时间就会有新的血肉兽从她的身上诞生。这些寄生的血肉兽使得裂殖母兽成为了一个可怖的绞肉机器。裂殖母兽很少出现在袭击中，通常只能通过仪式召唤。裂殖母兽在死亡时会进入休眠状态，并在一段时间后从中复生。</FH_Fissionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中涌现。</FH_Fissionmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
