  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Fissionmeld.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Fissionmeld.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: dreadmeld -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.label>惊惧母兽</FH_Dreadmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: A colossal amalgamation of dozens of smaller fleshbeasts, bound together by a loosely connected central nervous system. It uses its massive claws to tunnel through solid rock. Dreadmelds rarely appear on the surface, preferring to lurk in caves constructed from fleshmass blocks, with which they share a psychic bond for construction. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.description>由数几十只小型血肉兽组成的庞然大物，通过松散相连的中枢神经系统协调统一。它能用巨大的爪子在坚硬的岩石中挖掘隧道。惊惧母兽很少出现在地表，它更喜欢躲在用血肉块筑成的洞穴中。它与负责建造洞穴的血肉块间存在着心灵感应。</FH_Dreadmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Dreadmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>从{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}中涌现。</FH_Dreadmeld.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
