  <!-- EN: fleshtitan -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.label>血肉泰坦</FH_Fleshtitan.label>
  <!-- EN: The heart of the fleshbeast catastrophe - a fleshmass heart that has somehow grown limbs. Its extreme regenerative capabilities render it nearly invulnerable. Almost no known method can harm the fleshtitan. Its near-limitless strength allows it to destroy any obstacle in its path. The fleshtitan moves extremely slowly and will revert to a fleshmass heart after a period of time. -->
  <FH_Fleshtitan.description>血肉兽灾变的核心，一只不知如何长出肢体的血肉心脏。超快的再生速度让心脏几乎无懈可击。几乎没有任何已知的方式能够伤害血肉泰坦。近乎无限的怪力使其可以摧毁一切阻挡它前进的障碍。血肉泰坦的移动极其缓慢，而且会在一段时间后重新变为血肉心脏。</FH_Fleshtitan.description>
